{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decipher the Simulation of the Mind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/a4aacfd80a4d40632a334b9df9108d63.poster.avif?t=1767359685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/a4aacfd80a4d40632a334b9df9108d63.webm?t=1767359685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/a4aacfd80a4d40632a334b9df9108d63.mp4?t=1767359685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runway: 66</strong> is a psychological horror and sci-fi investigation experience where reality itself is the primary suspect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Gabriel</strong>, designated <i>Subject 66</i>\u00a0a man declared dead after a catastrophic plane crash, only to awaken inside a classified, government-backed simulation. Something has gone wrong. The world glitches. Memories contradict themselves. And a protocol known only as <strong>\u201cProtocol 66\u201d</strong> is actively reshaping your consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not merely trapped.<br>You are being studied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you must become the investigator of your own fractured mind uncovering who built the simulation, why your memories were altered, and what happens when a human subject begins to remember too much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/cd0e4d0d320967a096c17470ee0564f6.poster.avif?t=1767359685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/cd0e4d0d320967a096c17470ee0564f6.webm?t=1767359685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/cd0e4d0d320967a096c17470ee0564f6.mp4?t=1767359685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Investigative Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Evidence Gathering in a Fractured Reality</strong><br>Explore <strong>seven distinct, atmospheric chapters</strong>\u00a0from abandoned airport terminals to hidden military installations buried beneath layers of false reality. Collect classified documents, environmental clues, and experimental records that expose a government conspiracy and genetic experiments tied directly to the <strong>Malevolent Madness universe</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Cognitive Deduction &amp; Simulation Puzzles</strong><br>The simulation is imperfect and those imperfections are your greatest weapon. Identify logical inconsistencies, environmental glitches, and temporal loops to solve puzzles rooted in psychological trauma and corrupted system architecture. Progress requires actively <i>connecting the dots</i> between memory fragments and the world\u2019s distorted logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd3 <strong>Fragmented Memory Analysis</strong><br>Found notes, distorted recordings, and whispered voices act as your internal case file. Every shifting hallway and whispered name is a clue. Analyze the recurring presence of <strong>\u201cMaryam\u201d</strong> to understand her patterns and her unsettling connection to your identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <strong>Surveillance &amp; Strategic Stealth</strong><br>A dynamic AI entity observes, adapts, and manipulates the simulation around you. There is no direct confrontation. Survival depends on understanding the system\u2019s rules, tracking behavioral patterns, and exploiting technical flaws through stealth and environmental awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Decision-Driven Deductions</strong><br>Your choices are not moral they are diagnostic. Each decision permanently alters Gabriel\u2019s mental state and the simulation\u2019s response, leading to multiple investigative conclusions:<br><strong>Awakening</strong>, <strong>Truth</strong>, or <strong>Eternal Surrender</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/20fa1a4e3e39c7451c77273cbbad6329.poster.avif?t=1767359685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/20fa1a4e3e39c7451c77273cbbad6329.webm?t=1767359685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/extras/20fa1a4e3e39c7451c77273cbbad6329.mp4?t=1767359685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Truth Is Hidden in Terminal 66</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terminal 66 exists for one reason:<br><strong>You chose to forget.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the evidence needed to remember who you really are<br>or will you remain forever cataloged as <i>Subject 66</i> in a classified experiment that never ends?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Good Morning\u2026  ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667120/8ac77eef07d472487cee95beb0332ea6974eaac2.jpg"},{"name":"Is that my Mommy?   ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667120/c51168e58c048c9bc9e06b4e62b5a5c6cb7037c1.jpg"},{"name":"Jack In The Box","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667120/a5b23c8a8f6e429d0f71d7c1ba400c39fa65ccac.jpg"},{"name":"C++ OR C#","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667120/db0a451e86131986a89135d6c6938ada5214111a.jpg"},{"name":"Too Cold To Fight    ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667120/2c988d84bf9b5177b22bb902e323055a1e894071.jpg"},{"name":"Smells Like BT ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667120/096a41cad62a9eb2cee80dd6f677f71e3594d4c0.jpg"},{"name":"A Way Out?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667120/c7b74a4d9657ba987a7d1290ba63c81d7416f778.jpg"},{"name":"That's a Hell of a party\u2026 ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667120/135151ab9f4388375cb068d55e743df2594e796f.jpg"},{"name":"Beep Boop Bap Bop ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667120/3af2d93e1dded786e04881c555280d8c5a5d48aa.jpg"},{"name":"Brave Man... Or Coward?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667120/e52d54d449dcd7776545a44ed163c5d3d93f5fb1.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667120?t=1767359685","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/86e5c6b47c20ee0b770d163fa89894de0c53dd27/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767359685","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/cda54616de6f0dfedef2488334910da5b4b3cd73/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767359685","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667120/cda54616de6f0dfedef2488334910da5b4b3cd73/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767359685","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description